# Waterwind Scout: a 2/2 flyer that creates one Map token when it enters (CR 111.10s), and only then (attacking makes no second
# Map). On turn 3 it attacks past Bot2's Llanowar Elves (a creature without flying or reach cannot block a flyer, CR 702.9b), so
# the attack deals 2; in main 2 the Map ({1}, {T}, sacrifice, sorcery speed) makes the Scout explore (CR 701.44): the revealed
# Lightning Bolt is not a land, so the Scout gets a +1/+1 counter and Bot1 puts the Bolt into the graveyard.

